  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You force a creature into a lucid dream that you control.</p><p>Choose a thinking creature within <strong>10 spaces</strong>. It must make an opposed <strong>Willpower</strong> check or be <strong>Incapacitated </strong>until the start of your next turn.</p><p>While affected by this spell, the target dreams of whatever you wish to show it. If you choose to make the dream especially stressful or terrifying, the target takes <strong>1 Damage</strong> that ignores <strong>Armor</strong> at the start of its turn.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration of both the <strong>Damage</strong> and <strong>Incapacitated</strong> effect by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may increase the <strong>Damage</strong> by <strong>+1</strong> per extra success.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.dYsKhduhSkJBlvyp]{Mind Trap}</p>",
